<!-- STORY -->
<section class="lp-story" id="story">
  <div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-reveal"><p class="lp-quote">Every collection outlives its collector. Its stories should too.</p></div>
    <div class="lp-reveal">
      <div class="lp-eyebrow">Built in South Africa</div>
      <h2 class="lp-h2">A father&rsquo;s project became his <em>daughters&rsquo; business.</em></h2>
      <p class="lp-lede">Attesté started when a private collector realised his children would inherit his art, but not the stories behind it. Today it&rsquo;s a family enterprise in Stellenbosch: built by a father, operated by three daughters, and powered by the belief that every collection tells a story worth keeping.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

